<title>UK: Russian oil port Novorossiisk shut by storm.</title>
<headline>Russian oil port Novorossiisk shut by storm.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading Russian oil terminal Novorossiisk was closed by a thunderstorm on Thursday evening, a reliable shipping source said.</p>
<p>The Black Sea terminal, Russia's main outlet for Urals crude, was still shut on Friday morning.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 8060</p>
